cleanupTooltip:
{HEADER}Demount equipment that is not in the saved set{/HEADER}{BODY}Takes off every device that is not sitting in exactly the slot its vehicle’s saved set gives it, and puts it back in the depot.

Mainly for downgraded equipment: when a bounty device could not be sourced, the mod fitted the standard one instead. That device is not in the saved set, so it comes off here.

Vehicles with nothing saved are left alone, and nothing is removed that would cost credits, gold or a demount kit.{/BODY}
